# "For as long as you control Ty Lee" (CR 611.2b), the ruling: if Ty Lee is gone before her ability resolves, the creature is still tapped but
# the duration is over before it begins, so it untaps normally. Bot2 Bolts Ty Lee in response to the trigger: Memnite is tapped when the
# trigger resolves, and untaps in Bot2's untap step on turn 4.

